### Dashboard API Tests
### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = YOUR_AUTH0_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Full Dashboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Basic Metrics Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Test without Authorization (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats

###
